        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Natural colored linen warp and weft. Central field shows indistinct pattern of winged figures carrying caduceus-like staffs and flying above the town. Below, groups of sailing ships, borders along sides only; each shows undulating flowering vine. Hemmed at each end. Selvedges complete. Yarns very much worn; linen browned; a number of holes."@en ;
